Upgrade `voltdbclient` to 16.0.0 and use its topology-aware `VoltClient` for the native transport. The configured `host`/`hosts` are now seeds: the Agent discovers every cluster member, keeps a connection to each, and follows node failures, rejoins, and cluster expansions without a restart. Each check run sends its statistics calls concurrently instead of one at a time. The HTTP/VMC transport is unchanged.